{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Landed: Gerrit change 1914 merged to main as 09abac969c ('d30c: make the visibility poll re-query Jira'), LLM-Review +1 (rebar-review-bot) and Verified +1 (rebar-ci-bot). Root cause was AcliClient.search_issues memoizing per-JQL and caching negative results forever, which reduced the 120s index-visibility poll to a single-shot check; the fix evicts the cache entry before each poll query, mirroring the existing access_check.py pattern. No timeout, budget, or sleep interval was changed. Closing."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787174863619277001,"uuid":"de70cb45-909a-45e3-9708-6a698339ea26"}